      "id": "github:534519069",
      "name": "SwimClubMeet (SCM)",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "GPL-3.0 开源的游泳俱乐部比赛管理应用：维护会员，创建比赛场次与项目，接受报名，自动或手动编排分组/泳道，打印检录与计时表，录入成绩并生成报告；以 Windows 桌面客户端加本地 SQL Server Express 自托管运行。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Artanemus/SCM_SwimClubMeet-R",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/Artanemus/SCM_SwimClubMeet-R",
      "github_repository_id": 534519069,
      "license": "GPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Artanemus/SCM_SwimClubMeet-R/license",
      "features": [
        "会员数据管理",
        "创建比赛场次与项目",
        "会员报名/提名到具体项目",
        "自动或手动生成 heats 与泳道安排",
        "打印 marshal、timekeeper 等比赛用表",
        "录入比赛成绩并生成 20 余种报告",
        "支持 TimeDrops 与 Dolphin Timing 计时设备"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Windows 桌面应用，本地安装",
        "需安装 Microsoft SQL Server Express 2017 或以上",
        "使用 SCM_BuildMeAClub-R 初始化 SwimClubMeet 数据库",
        "可离线运行，无需订阅或互联网连接"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Delphi / Embarcadero RAD Studio 12.3",
        "FastReport VCL",
        "FireDAC",
        "Microsoft SQL Server Express"
      ],
